{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04008","headline":"晦日宴高氏林亭 · 高峤","name":"晦日宴高氏林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞观写春望，开宴坐汀沙。\n积溜含苔色，晴空荡日华。\n歌入平阳第，舞对石崇家。\n莫虑能骑马，投辖自停车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04008.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04008","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}